out 362
cores rollback: name one core
Usage: cores ls [--installed|--available|--updates|--unsupported] [<console>] | cores info <core> | cores fetch | cores get <core>... | cores update [<core>...] | cores rollback <core> | cores rm <core>... | cores verify [<core>...] | cores wait [cores<n>]
  A core is named by its file's stem, as cores ls prints it. See man cores.
